H-MEM conformance runner
========================

runner.ts and vectors/vectors.json in this directory are the official H-MEM
conformance suite from the Meterless project:

  Source:  https://github.com/Meterless/Meterless
  Paths:   engines/hmem/conformance/runner.ts
           engines/hmem/conformance/vectors/vectors.json
  Commit:  1742dec56a66e58eef9dda2d2b865823758ca8cd
  License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (full text in LICENSE next to this file)
  Copyright 2026 Meterless

The files are vendored unmodified (line endings normalised to LF). They are not
part of Lotline's own code and are excluded from the repo's type-check.
Lotline's implementation under test lives in packages/engines/hmem and is run
against this suite with:

  pnpm conformance:hmem
